Error [E0121]: `holder.buf` was consumed by `Buffer.seal`, so it can't be used here
  --> receiver_take_field_use_after.jet:12:22
    |
 12 |     print(holder.buf.text)
    |                      ^^^^
  --> receiver_take_field_use_after.jet:10:6
    |
 10 |     ^holder.buf.seal()
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^ `holder.buf` moved to `Buffer.seal` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `holder.buf` after the move, or give `Buffer.seal` a copy with `holder.buf.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
